Quiet syncEntityViews re-called updateLod every visible root every frame.
Ships already self-retained; asteroid/station applyProjectedDetailLod still
re-traversed. Central retain stamp skips updateLod while hysteresis keeps the
same band; asteroid + station updateLod mirror shipKit lastLod. Bind clears
the stamp so rebound meshes re-apply. Bench toggle restores always-call.

Offline floor (36 ship + 11 asteroid + 3 station × 20k): median ~3.9–4.2×,
floor ≥3.33× across 5×11 isolated pairs. Dirty-wake on band change proved.
Soft-GPU fps not claimed. Picture contract ON.
---
